    <briefdescription>
<para>Concrete <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_chain_of_thought_tracer" kindref="compound">IChainOfThoughtTracer</ref></computeroutput> that records all spans in memory. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Intended for unit testing and offline analysis. Thread-safe: internal storage is protected by a mutex so the same instance can be shared by concurrent builders (though that is unusual in practice). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
